cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results it backs, please cite the paper below."
title: "BookDiT: Reducing Autoregressive Rollout Drift in Limit Order Book World Models"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of BookDiT, a 0.95M-parameter flow-matching diffusion transformer that
  generates limit order book states in a structured coordinate chart, so that positive spreads and
  monotone price ladders hold by construction, and autoregressive rollout drift is reduced over
  long horizons.
type: software
